#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/flashing/erasing.rst:51
msgid ""
"The **OpenMV AE3** has a single writable FAT filesystem shared by both "
"Cortex-M55 cores, erased once via ``-a 5``. There is no separate per-core "
"filesystem erase."
msgstr ""
"La **OpenMV AE3** ha un unico filesystem FAT scrivibile condiviso da "
"entrambi i core Cortex-M55, cancellato una sola volta tramite ``-a 5``\\ . "
"Non esiste una cancellazione separata del filesystem per ciascun core."

